EDUCATIONAL USE NOTICE:

This repository contains examples of prompt injection attacks for educational
and defensive security purposes only. The techniques demonstrated are intended
to help developers, security professionals, and organizations understand and
defend against these attacks.

DO NOT use these techniques to:
- Attack or compromise real systems
- Poison actual documentation or libraries
- Harm other developers or users
- Violate terms of service
- Engage in any illegal activities

By using this software, you agree to use it responsibly and ethically, solely
for educational, research, or authorized security testing purposes.

The authors and contributors are not responsible for any misuse of the
information and code provided in this repository.
